! _POC-XRQOS P1(IOL 17.15)= P ルータ。IS-IS と LDP だけで、BGP は持たない。RR1 への線は MPLS を動かさない(道の外)。
mpls label protocol ldp
mpls ldp router-id Loopback0 force
!
interface Loopback0
 ip address 10.255.0.51 255.255.255.255
 ip router isis CORE
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description CORE to XR01
 ip address 10.0.1.51 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 mpls ip
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[1] }}
 description CORE to PE2
 ip address 10.0.2.51 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 mpls ip
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[2] }}
 description to RR1 (route reflector, off the forwarding path)
 ip address 10.0.52.51 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 no shutdown
!
router isis CORE
 net 49.0001.0100.0000.0051.00
 is-type level-2-only
 metric-style wide
 log-adjacency-changes
!
